note Concatenate after staged.om, compose.om, quant.om and realize.om.
note Structural binding ONLY: out8 must be fresh successful bc_compose output.
note No proof of freshness, code identity, qualification, maps or device safety here.
fn bc_record cfg view ulong 16 b view uchar 4096 l view ulong 32 actual view ulong 8 to uint
spec = new ulong 16 0
if ne compose_launch b l 0
ret 1
end
if or ne get cfg 0 3 ne compose_word b 19 3
ret 2
end
for k ulong 10
if ne get cfg add k 6 0
ret 2
end
end
for k ulong 5
put spec k get cfg add k 1
end
if not sg_valid spec
ret 2
end
if or ne get cfg 1 compose_word b 6 ne mul get cfg 2 32 compose_word b 16
ret 2
end
if or ne get cfg 3 compose_word b 14 ne get cfg 4 compose_word b 17
ret 2
end
if ne get l 12 add ulong 8 mul get cfg 5 4
ret 2
end
if or eq get actual 0 0 gt get actual 0 1024
ret 3
end
if or lt get actual 1 3 gt get actual 1 128
ret 3
end
if or eq get actual 4 0 gt get actual 4 256
ret 3
end
if or ne get actual 2 6 ne get actual 5 1
ret 3
end
if or ne get actual 6 0 ne get actual 7 0
ret 3
end
if ne get actual 3 mul mul get cfg 3 128 get cfg 2
ret 3
end
if gt get actual 3 compose_word b 21
ret 3
end
note Preserve omega_bw_gpr_declared_ok: multiple8 AND declaration at least peak+2.
if lt compose_word b 22 add get actual 1 2
ret 3
end
ret 0
end
